Fe), and Nickel (Ni), we need to examine their respective electron configurations.</p>\n<p>Chromium has the electron configuration:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16.3ex\" height=\"2.452ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -833.9 7204.8 1083.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">Cr</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1477.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2533.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"5B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(2811.6,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">Ar</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4011.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"5D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(4289.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(4789.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(606.2,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(5799.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(6299.3,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D460\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D460\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(502,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Based on this configuration, Chromium has a total of six valence electrons (1 from the 4s orbital and 5 from the 3d orbital). </p>\n<p>Chromium is noted for having the lowest enthalpy of atomization among the given metals. Thus, the number of valence electrons in Chromium, the metal with the lowest enthalpy of atomization, is 6.</p>"},"hi":{"direction":null,"comprehension":null,"content":"<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"9.779ex\" height=\"2.034ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -705 4322.3 899\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"72\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-72\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1114,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1558.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"6F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6F\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2780.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(3225.3,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"46\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-46\"></use><use data-c=\"65\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-65\" transform=\"translate(653,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> और Ni में से कणन की निम्नतम एन्थैल्पी वाली धातु में उपस्थित संयोजकता इलेक्ट्रॉनों की संख्या है","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"10"},{"identifier":"B","content":"6"},{"identifier":"C","content":"9"},{"identifier":"D","content":"8"}],"correct_options":["B"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>क्रोमियम (Cr), कोबाल्ट (Co), आयरन (Fe), और निकल (Ni) में से सबसे कम परमाणुकरण एन्थैल्पी वाली धातु में संयोजी इलेक्ट्रॉनों की संख्या निर्धारित करने के लिए, हमें उनके संबंधित इलेक्ट्रॉन विन्यासों की जांच करनी होगी।</p>\n<p>क्रोमियम का इलेक्ट्रॉन विन्यास है:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16.3ex\" height=\"2.452ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -833.9 7204.8 1083.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">Cr</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1477.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2533.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"5B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(2811.6,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">Ar</text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4011.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"5D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(4289.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(4789.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D451\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D451\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(606.2,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(5799.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(6299.3,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D460\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D460\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(502,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>इस विन्यास के आधार पर, क्रोमियम में कुल छह संयोजी इलेक्ट्रॉन हैं (4s कक्षक से 1 और 3d कक्षक से 5)।</p>\n<p>क्रोमियम दी गई धातुओं में सबसे कम परमाणुकरण एन्थैल्पी के लिए जाना जाता है। इस प्रकार, सबसे कम परमाणुकरण एन्थैल्पी वाली धातु क्रोमियम में संयोजी इलेक्ट्रॉनों की संख्या 6 है।</p>"}},"subject":"chemistry","timeAllotted":144000,"topic":"periodic-table-and-its-features","type":"mcq","year":2025,"isOutOfSyllabus":false,"isBonus":false,"tags":[],"yearKey":"jee-main-2025-online-7th-april-morning-shift","active":true,"options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"10"},{"identifier":"B","content":"6"},{"identifier":"C","content":"9"},{"identifier":"D","content":"8"}],"correct_options":["B"],"explanation":"<p>To determine the number of valence electrons in the metal with the lowest enthalpy of atomization among Chromium (Cr), Cobalt (Co), Iron (Fe), and Nickel (Ni), we need to examine their respective electron configurations.</p>\n<p>Chromium has the electron configuration:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16.3ex\" height=\"2.452ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -833.9 7204.8 1083.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mte